      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T18:21:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The mDeviceBusy should be set back to false in onCharacteristicWrite or if timeout exception occurs - can you please provide more analysis/logs of how the state where mDeviceBusy is never set back to false occurs? \n\nPlease feel free to attach more information in the bug, thanks!",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1487,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 1487,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "d110715e713fea55db42b84630843af5f8fbe015",
